908842187_1679437853687891_2310294550816102482_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qb0bBvL9WyEQ7kNvwFY65CZ&_nc_oc=AdogXHdHfqXwm29a-ZRBUI_JpfsCwdA5pNoQJ48ro6kfjcrIWeyZTHX4Oib2uPtFJtA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUzMgtpgIk_t0YNq_A1t71k_UVc2xjnUCOB5Nu1FxxMaQ&oe=6B105644"}, {"file_name": "4-first-reflections.png", "id": "1665808055002703", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908842209_1665808058336036_8954002171994802582_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O_OBqFQ2d8gQ7kNvwE47ogW&_nc_oc=AdodMMHOfttg-yw9NJ1fWXYr47N4eQhLsfbDNdmgoyYPDwJRRRD81E48wkg-GMg6jb8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVIeDCl1-hYM3cmjlSIhF-7DOWXHwDKfc0PxVyVn1SMjg&oe=6B103657"}, {"file_name": "5-all-speakers.png", "id": "1209508058066352", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908842204_1209508061399685_6294191689204741221_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZkjWhzydZNkQ7kNvwGRut4-&_nc_oc=AdpDgg7s5Y6H1cglwbIRHsEodpQIiKmokF-8Zmto7PyhMpgo9-kxoA2WmlnbsFuo0Kk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVOVF8ASuY0VZEahXalYLXxVqJzNOJMcMwJWZnirwZ9JA&oe=6B104EC2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Shotcut_00_00_17_610.png", "id": "2378857429534159", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771266_2378857432867492_3845469043136193811_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zJgqMox3dAUQ7kNvwHuTO8-&_nc_oc=Ado2aEsOZWVabFQoxBb5I8HQ4d4MRQM6YdQdvyC19dpPsYJwL6b6u4JuUs1B1OhA6nM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWRiUL_VI0pRyik_5w12uO-NbWaU-NKUQazJbDzJh1Z9w&oe=6B105E49"}, "display_name": "Speaker & Acoustics Planner", "keywords": ["acoustics", "audio", "cinema", "plan", "passthrough"], "long_description": "Plan your home theater where it will actually stand \u2013 **in your own room, in mixed reality.**\n\nSpeaker & Acoustics Planner reads the room scan from your headset's Space Setup: walls, doors, windows and furniture. It finds your screen (or suggests one on the wall you face), takes your seat as the listening position, and places every speaker at the angles home theater standards recommend.\n\n# How it works\n- Choose a layout: **2.0, 5.1, 5.1.2, 7.1, 7.1.2 or 7.1.4**\n- Speakers go **on the wall, on stands or mixed** \u2013 around your furniture, clear of doors, with a clear path to your seat\n- Real cabinet sizes, with how far to turn and tilt each speaker toward you\n- Furniture that blocks a speaker or covers the screen turns pink\n\n# Hear and see the sound\n- **Music plays from the virtual speakers in 3D**, so you hear the layout before you buy a single cable\n- Sound waves travel from each speaker to your seat\n- **First reflections** are marked on the walls, floor and ceiling \u2013 exactly where acoustic panels, a rug or a curtain belong\n\n# Take it with you\n- Save a top-down plan as an **SVG drawing** with every speaker's position, height, angle and distance, the panels to place, and the settings for your receiver\n\n**Stereo is free.** Surround and height layouts and saving the plan are part of **Pro**, a one-time in-app purchase.\n\nRequires a completed Space Setup room scan.", "short_description": "Plan your home theater in your real room. Speaker & Acoustics Planner reads your room scan, finds your screen and seat, and places every speaker \u2013 from stereo to 7.1.4 \u2013 at the right angle, on the wall or on stands, around your furniture. Hear the layout from virtual speakers, see where sound bounces off the walls and where acoustic panels belong, and save the plan for installation."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.narova.ee/it/SpeakerPlanner/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Narova Digital", "support_websi